NEW FEATURES / ENDPOINTS (for Flutter)

Base URL: /api

========================
1) User Features
========================

1.1 Get User Profile (includes emergency contact if set)
GET /UsersIdentity/Profile/{userId}
Response 200:
{
  "userId": "string",
  "fullName": "string",
  "phoneNumber": "string",
  "email": "string",
  "image": "string",
  "userType": "string",
  "gender": "string",
  "emergencyContact": {
    "name": "string",
    "phoneNumber": "string"
  }
}

1.2 Update User Profile (name / phone / profile picture)
PUT /UsersIdentity/UpdateProfile/{userId}
Body:
{
  "fullName": "string (optional)",
  "phoneNumber": "string (optional)",
  "image": "string (optional, can be url/base64 depending on app usage)"
}
Response 200:
{ "message": "User profile updated successfully." }
Notes:
- phoneNumber must be unique (cannot be used by another account).

1.3 Get Emergency Contact
GET /UsersIdentity/EmergencyContact/{userId}
Response 200:
{
  "name": "string",
  "phoneNumber": "string"
}

1.4 Save/Update Emergency Contact
PUT /UsersIdentity/EmergencyContact/{userId}
Body:
{
  "name": "string (optional)",
  "phoneNumber": "string (optional)"
}
Response 200:
{ "message": "Emergency contact saved successfully." }
Notes:
- Emergency contact is stored in Identity Claims (no DB schema change).
- Sending null/empty for a field removes it.

